Package: rocm-hipsparse
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 rocm-cmake,
 rocm-core,
 rocm-env,
 rocm-hip-on-rocclr,
 rocm-rocsparse,
Description: Next generation LAPACK implementation for ROCm platform  - binary
 hipSPARSE is a SPARSE marshalling library with multiple supported backends. It
 sits between your application and a 'worker' SPARSE library, where it marshals
 inputs to the backend library and marshals results to your application.
 hipSPARSE exports an interface that doesn't require the client to change,
 regardless of the chosen backend. Currently, hipSPARSE supports rocSPARSE and
 NVIDIA CUDA cuSPARSE backends.

